  "details": "Hi, I have a world that I released last Friday, and on 5/31, it randomly entered private without any explanation. No reports, and average lab-player count. \nMy other world, has also been in labs for nearly two weeks now but hasn't exited out of it, although it's completely dead due to how far down it is.\nAny solution for this would be great.\nBoth worlds: \nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_64e7003c-e4b0-4bed-a0e1-f718f76fd8b8\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_e8183c86-ec28-4fc2-ac93-45d55526ae23",
